@startuml DFD_Level0_Context_Diagram
title Level 0 DFD — Context Diagram\nCO2 Tracker Application

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
  BorderColor #388E3C
  FontSize 13
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1976D2
}
skinparam arrow {
  Color #546E7A
  FontSize 11
}

actor "User" as User
actor "Firebase\n(Auth / Firestore)" as Firebase
actor "Device\n(GPS / Camera)" as Device

rectangle "CO2 Tracker\nSystem\n\n[0]" as System

User --> System : Login credentials\nActivity data\nBill images
System --> User : Dashboard insights\nAchievements\nRecommendations

System --> Firebase : Authentication requests\nActivity logs (read/write)\nUser profile data
Firebase --> System : Auth tokens\nStored emission records\nRemote configuration

Device --> System : GPS coordinates\nCamera / gallery images
System --> Device : Location requests\nOCR scan triggers

@enduml
